@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Browse Products & Add to Cart

actor USER
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "System" as SYS
database "Database" as DB

== Browse Products ==
USER -> UI: View product list / categories
UI -> SYS: getProducts(categoryId, keyword)
SYS -> DB: SELECT products + category
DB --> SYS: product list
SYS --> UI: Return products
UI --> USER: Display product list

USER -> UI: Select a product
UI -> SYS: getProductDetail(productId)
SYS -> DB: SELECT product detail
DB --> SYS: product detail
SYS --> UI: Return product detail
UI --> USER: Display product detail

== Add to Cart ==
USER -> UI: Add to cart(productId, qty)
UI -> SYS: addToCart(userId, productId, qty)
SYS -> DB: findOrCreateCart(userId)
DB --> SYS: cart

SYS -> DB: checkProductStock(productId)
DB --> SYS: stockQuantity

alt Stock available
  SYS -> DB: upsertCartItem(cartId, productId, qty)
  DB --> SYS: updated cart item
  SYS --> UI: Return success + cart summary
  UI --> USER: Display "Added to cart"
else Out of stock
  SYS --> UI: Return out-of-stock message
  UI --> USER: Display error message
end

@enduml
